OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for Scottish ferry to
OL,4,Amainland Europe scrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to resurrect a ferry service
OL,7,Fbetween Scotland and mainland Europe
OL,8,Fhave been scrapped.
OL,10,FForth Ports said it had concerns over
OL,11,Fthe "long-term viability" of the
OL,12,Fproposed route between Rosyth in Fife
OL,13,Fand Dunkirk in northern France.
OL,15,FThe port owners had been in talks with
OL,16,FDanish shipping company DFDS over
OL,17,Foperating the route after the Scottish
OL,18,Fand UK governments each committed #3m
OL,19,Fto the project.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
