OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for Scottish ferry to
OL,4,Amainland Europe scrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Forth Ports said its focus had
OL,7,Fshifted to "delivering alternative
OL,8,Factivity at the port" after considering
OL,9,F"a number of important economic
OL,10,Ffactors".
